  'NetworkPacketsOut → 선택 기간 평균 PPS': { en: 'NetworkPacketsOut → average PPS over the selected range', zh: 'NetworkPacketsOut → 所选时间段的平均 PPS', ja: 'NetworkPacketsOut → 選択期間の平均 PPS' },
  'EBSReadOps → 선택 기간 평균 IOPS — 인스턴스 관점 EBS I/O': { en: 'EBSReadOps → average IOPS over the selected range — EBS I/O from the instance perspective', zh: 'EBSReadOps → 所选时间段的平均 IOPS — 实例视角的 EBS I/O', ja: 'EBSReadOps → 選択期間の平均 IOPS — インスタンス視点の EBS I/O' },
  'EBSWriteOps → 선택 기간 평균 IOPS': { en: 'EBSWriteOps → average IOPS over the selected range', zh: 'EBSWriteOps → 所选时间段的平均 IOPS', ja: 'EBSWriteOps → 選択期間の平均 IOPS' },
